# Bird of the Day — supercronic crontab.
#
# Daily generation at 07:00 UTC. The GitHub Actions workflow the repository
# ships as .github/bird-of-the-day.yml.example runs at 07:17 instead: a
# queued scheduled run is best effort, so it picks an odd minute to stay out
# of the top-of-the-hour pile-up. A container's cron has no such queue and
# fires when it says it will. To change this schedule, edit this file and
# rebuild the image (or mount a custom one at /etc/supercronic/crontab).
#
# Format: standard crontab. supercronic logs each run to stdout, so the
# Python script's logging falls through to `docker logs`.

0 7 * * * /opt/venv/bin/python -m scripts.generate
